<section id="aboutWho" class="section-content section-margin article-text">
    <div class="gap-v gap-h">
        <article class="gap-v gap-h">
            <p>I enjoy working on UX/UI design, branding, and typography, with a focus on accessibility and research. I
                love working with and for colleagues and clients alike through empathy and accessibility-centered design
                principles. Ensuring that design is accessible to all enshrines that it is usable for anyone, regardless
                of circumstance. I believe that good design should not be obvious, but be a seamless form of
                communication between the end product and its users.</p>
            <p>In my free time, I play electric bass, geek out over public transit, create new things at my local
                woodshop, and cook new recipes I find out in the world or online. I also love going out on adventures
                with my camera wherever I am.</p>
        </article>
        <aside>
            <figure><img src="img/about/SWydra.jpg"
                    alt="A portrait of a white man with brown glasses and blue collared shirt"></figure>
        </aside>
    </div>
</section>